body:
IMO, Django docs are not the right proper place to describe solutions to OPS issues. I'd limit this section to a brief description of what and how can be set, e.g.

```
If you need to use a role for database connections, set it in the
:setting:`OPTIONS` part of your database configuration in
:setting:`DATABASES`::

    DATABASES = {
        # ...
        "OPTIONS": {
            "assume_role": "my_application_role",
        },
    }
```
